# Writing pages

Markdown is compiled with [marked](https://marked.js.org/) (GitHub-flavored), so tables,
fenced code blocks and task lists all work.

## Headings

Every `##` to `######` heading gets an `id`, and pages with two or more of them show an
"On this page" table of contents.

## Checking your content

Run the `markdown:check` script to compile every folder without building the app: it fails
on duplicate slugs and broken links between pages.
